+ * taken from the raphael cfg-blob reg table (goodix_gt9886_cfg_f11.bin)
+ * which the vendor driver programs verbatim (goodix_ts_i2c.c). The IC
+ * also requires its 784-byte panel config download on every boot --
+ * without it the firmware never posts touch frames. Frame at 0x4100:
+ * b[0] event flags (bit7 touch, bit6 request, bit5 gesture), b[1] bit4
